This repository's code, documentation, map renderings, and pin/mine records are
licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/).

Why this license: the pipeline derives from the EOX Sentinel-2 cloudless composite,
which is itself CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 — ShareAlike flows the NC-SA terms downstream.

Not covered: underlying third-party imagery and data keep their own terms —
Esri World Imagery (research use), USGS SRTM tiles (public domain),
SGM El Aguajito sheet (SGM public release), OSM (ODbL). Each published record
carries its own `license` field; map sheets print source credits in the footer.
